Cell["7. A thousand qubits, exact entanglement", "Subsection",
 CellID->1623037933,ExpressionUUID->"2f033ec3-9a32-909c-7083-40bd441fab38"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Twenty thousand random Clifford gates on 1000 qubits, a state with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox["2", "1000"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4c2e91a3-1004-1d59-32b8-0e95b9cbf3c2"],
 " amplitudes, then its entanglement entropy as an exact integer, read off \
the generators restricted to half the chain ",
