Cell["\<\
Six photons in, 1000 detector patterns drawn directly with the \
Clifford-Clifford algorithm, never building the probability table; the twenty \
most frequent, with their observed frequencies:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1224652745,ExpressionUUID->"2f577d8e-9969-8d1d-4959-51e3b361ad02"],

